<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Dashboard · NexoraMart</title><link rel="manifest" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/manifest.webmanifest"><link rel="stylesheet" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/css/style.css"></head><body data-ctx="<%=request.getContextPath()%>"><header class="nav"><div class="brand-mark"><b>NEXORA<span>MART</span></b><small>SMART CAMPUS COMMERCE</small></div><a href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/marketplace">Marketplace</a><a href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/logout">Logout</a></header><main class="dash ultimate-dash"><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT SPACE</p><h1>Welcome, <%=session.getAttribute("userName")%> 👋</h1><p class="muted">Role: <b><%=session.getAttribute("userRole")%></b> · Your account keeps the same secure session rules as the capstone baseline.</p><div class="dash-grid"><article><span>DISCOVER</span><h2>Smart Marketplace</h2><p>Search, voice-search, wishlist, compare and smart-match products.</p><a class="button" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/marketplace">Open Marketplace →</a></article><article><span>ASSIST</span><h2>Nexora Assistant</h2><p>Ask catalog questions and get explainable product matches from the built-in assistant.</p><a class="button ghost" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/marketplace#smart">Open Smart Tools →</a></article><% if("SELLER".equals(session.getAttribute("userRole"))){%><article><span>SELLER</span><h2>Manage Products</h2><p>Create products with rich specifications and three local image slots.</p><a class="button" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/seller/dashboard">Seller Command Center →</a></article><article><span>SELLER</span><h2>Customer Orders</h2><p>Process order status updates and respond to product reviews.</p><a class="button ghost" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/seller/orders">Customer Orders →</a></article><% } %><% if("BUYER".equals(session.getAttribute("userRole"))){%><article><span>BUYER</span><h2>My Cart</h2><p>Update quantities, remove items and continue to checkout.</p><a class="button" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/cart">View Cart 🛒</a></article><article><span>BUYER</span><h2>My Orders</h2><p>Track status, open references and cancel eligible pending orders.</p><a class="button ghost" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/orders">My Orders →</a></article><% } %><% if("ADMIN".equals(session.getAttribute("userRole"))){%><article><span>CONTROL</span><h2>Admin Control Center</h2><p>Moderate users, products and orders while reviewing audit activity.</p><a class="button" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/admin">Admin Control Center →</a></article><% } %></div></main><script src="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/js/nexora.js"></script><script src="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/js/theme.js"></script>
</body></html>